{"title":"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 12","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If the (convex) area bounded by the x-axis and the lines <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/9/769e2e428a543d3da1a63fd3647f39431cffe2f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=mx+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"91\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/c/5/4c52e02a35db152495396584bfeae1d0599cd753.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/7/2e7d65cfa316d639c9267398009812f3eb45fea9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x=4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"46\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/a/e0a0db32027a732ac57d37ef2ae9bb150f65b108.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> equals:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/7/c47e189cf269411a58724c88d855deac7c1c6846.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ -\\frac{1}{2}\\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ -\\frac{2}{3}\\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ -\\frac{3}{2} \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ -2 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ \\text{none of these}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"536\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Answer\">Answer</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Answer\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/3/c/13c3218ca790f4eac4048f34f68433655b19e1f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\fbox{B}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME\" title=\"1967 AHSME\">1967 AHSC</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1967 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1967\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">Problem 11</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1967_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1967 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.p